{"id":"93b5a2bbb2792c2a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MProofRow.md","title":"MProofRow","display":"MProofRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"MProofRow","parameters":["e","g","z348","z349","z350"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"MProofRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>e</span><span>g</span><span>z348</span><span>z349</span><span>z350</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：正规模态。有序参数：<code>e</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>z348</code>、<code>z349</code>、<code>z350</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ MProofRow e g z348 z349 z350)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z351\n  (exists z352\n    (and\n      (@ Pair z351 z352 z350)\n      (and\n        (@ FmM z351)\n        (and\n          (@ Finite z352)\n          (and\n            (@ Subset z352 g)\n            (or\n              (and (@ MAx e z351) (@ Empty z352))\n              (or\n                (and (in z351 g) (@ Single z351 z352))\n                (or\n                  (exists z354\n                    (exists z355\n                      (exists z356\n                        (exists z357\n                          (exists z358\n                            (exists z359\n                            (exists z360\n                            (exists z361\n                            (and\n                            (in z360 z349)\n                            (and\n                            (in z361 z349)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z348 z360 z358)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z348 z361 z359)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Pair z354 z356 z358)\n                            (and (@ Pair z355 z357 z359) (and (@ PImp z354 z351 z355) (@ Union2 z356 z357 z352))))))))))))))))\n                  (exists z362\n                    (exists z363\n                      (exists z364\n                        (exists z365\n                          (and\n                            (in z365 z349)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z348 z365 z364)\n                            (and (@ Pair z362 z363 z364) (and (@ Empty z363) (and (@ PBox z362 z351) (@ Empty z352)))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b6471a8f381739eb\" href=\"?note=b6471a8f381739eb\" title=\"ZFC_Empty\">Empty</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee0b315916cb8bff\" href=\"?note=ee0b315916cb8bff\" title=\"ZFC_Finite\">Finite</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"852442b30ad8fc4e\" href=\"?note=852442b30ad8fc4e\" title=\"ZFC_FmM\">FmM</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6f226bfb5fcb432c\" href=\"?note=6f226bfb5fcb432c\" title=\"ZFC_MAx\">MAx</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d00664d192427d28\" href=\"?note=d00664d192427d28\" title=\"ZFC_PBox\">PBox</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"bdbfd129fa484068\" href=\"?note=bdbfd129fa484068\" title=\"ZFC_Single\">Single</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5b37d2d8ba4703a7\" href=\"?note=5b37d2d8ba4703a7\" title=\"ZFC_Subset\">Subset</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"bb2bfe91c0c7d416\" href=\"?note=bb2bfe91c0c7d416\" title=\"ZFC_Union2\">Union2</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ MProofRow e g z348 z349 z350)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_MAx|MAx]]；[[ZFC_PBox|PBox]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Empty","status":"resolved","id":"b6471a8f381739eb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_MAx|MAx]]；[[ZFC_PBox|PBox]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Finite","status":"resolved","id":"ee0b315916cb8bff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_FmM|FmM]]；[[ZFC_MAx|MAx]]；[[ZFC_PBox|PBox]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]；[[ZFC_Union2|